        "text": {
            "description_html": "<B>Schlage B664P, Grade 1 Commercial One Sided Keyed Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>This ANSI Grade 1 Single Cylinder Deadbolt is made for high level use. A one sided deadbolt, it has no trim on the inside <b>(Can NOT be unlocked from the inside)</b>. For doors with a 2-3/4 inch backset from 1-5/8 inches up to 2 inches thick. Requires 1-1/2 inch cross bore. A heavy-duty deadbolt, it is UL listed for a 3-hour fire door with a metal dust box reinforcer with three 3\" screws. Available in 6 finishes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Cylinder Lock</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from one side. <b>It does not have inside trim.</b> Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown. Requires 1-1/2\"cross bore hole.</p>\r\n \r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Schlage Commercial B664P One Sided Keyed Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Metal dust box reinforcer with three 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage 6-pin C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n<li>NASI A156.5, 2001, Grade 1.</li>\r\n<li>UL listed for 3-hour fire door</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage One Sided Keyed Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 1-1/2\" Required.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Range: 1-5/8\" - 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\", square corner, box</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1-1/8\" - 2-1/4\", square corner faceplate, 1\" housing diameter, 1\" throw</li>\r\n</ul></p>",
